marie: eMMC root device (SDHCI PIO backend for sweet_ufs.c)

The Kirin 710 eMMC host (sdhci@FF3E1000, SDHCI registers at 0xFF3E6000)
as fastboot leaves it: card in transfer state (RCA 1), HS400, no CMDQ,
user area (milestone 2 probe). Under SWEET_MARIE the UFS hardware layer
is replaced by polled PIO (CMD17/18/24/25 with auto CMD12, CMD8, CMD6
cache flush) with 512-byte device blocks; GPT lookup, partition fence
(now covering the 34-sector primary GPT), strategy, ioctls and the
persistent log are shared. Same node (/sweet-ufs) and rd=ufsroot0.

